# $apply with named args: dict with string keys becomes named args
[
  f: [fn [let x y] [+ x y]]
  args: [x: 10 y: 20]
  result: [apply f args]
]
=== out
Dict({"f": Function(x, y), "args": Dict({"x": Int(10), "y": Int(20)}), "result": Int(30)})

